OL,3,A81,000 warning letters sent to crypto
OL,4,Aholders in HMRC tax crackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FHM Revenue and Customs (HMRC) sent more
OL,7,Fthan 81,000 letters warning
OL,8,Fcryptocurrency holders they may owe
OL,9,Fcapital gains tax in the past year.
OL,11,FA Freedom of Information (FOI) request
OL,12,Fseen by the BBC showed the number of
OL,13,Fletters sent by the tax authority had
OL,14,Falmost tripled since 2024.
OL,16,FInvestors could face fines or
OL,17,Fprosecution if they fail to declare
OL,18,Fprofits they made from selling, even if
OL,19,Fthey exchange one cryptocurrency for
OL,20,Fanother.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,112,105,200,160,0,100
